      "message": "Not directly related to this CL.\nI assume ESPI_VWIRE_SIGNAL_PLTRST of this event notifies there is chipset reset(the new name is AP_POWER_RESET). Also zephyr driver(like NPCX) has reset event. Isn\u0027t the reset coming from ap_pwrseq?",
